#. Explanation shown under the "Close to Tray (keep running)" setting
#. (Settings > General > Window). Explanation shown under the "Keep Running
#. in Background" setting (Settings > General > Window).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"With \"Start Minimized\" and \"Fullscreen\" this is the classic cast-target "
"setup: the app waits out of the way, plays fullscreen when something casts "
"to it, and goes back to waiting when the video ends or you press Q."
msgstr ""
"配合“启动时最小化”和“全屏”选项，这就构成了经典的投屏接收设置：应用在后台静"
"候，接收到投屏内容时自动全屏播放，而在视频结束或你按下 Q 键后，便会恢复到待机"
"状态。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Language Filter" list of language codes
#. (Settings > Playback > Subtitles & Languages). The "two switches below it"
#. are the next two checkboxes on that screen. "und" is the ISO 639 code for
#. an undetermined language and is not translated.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"This list does nothing on its own -- turn on one of the two switches below "
"it. It changes which tracks the audio and subtitle menus offer you, not "
"which one is picked automatically; the preset above is what does that. "
"\"und\" means untagged, so removing it hides untagged tracks as well."
msgstr ""

#. Explanation shown under the track-preset dropdown (Settings > Playback >
#. Subtitles & Languages). "Subbed", "Dubbed", "shows only" and "Custom" are
#. that dropdown's own options and should read the same way they are
#. translated there. "Signs and songs" subtitles translate on-screen text and
#. song lyrics only, for a viewer listening to a dub.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Subbed\" keeps the original audio and adds full subtitles in your "
"language. \"Dubbed\" prefers audio in your language with signs and songs "
"subtitles, and falls back to subbed where there is no dub. The \"shows "
"only\" pair leaves films at whatever the server picks. The subbed presets "
"assume the original audio is Japanese; if yours is not, choose Custom and "
"write the rules yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Explanation shown under the "Language" setting (Settings > General >
#. This Device).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The percentage is how much of this app that language has been translated so "
"far; the rest stays in English. Translations are contributed at "
"translate.jellyfin.org."
msgstr ""

#. Explanation shown under the "Tell Me About Updates" setting (Settings >
#. General > This Device).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Automatic\" turns this off inside a Flatpak, where your desktop already "
"announces updates and \"flatpak update\" installs them, and leaves it on "
"everywhere else."
msgstr ""

#. Explanation shown under the "Game Controller" setting (Settings >
#. General > Input).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Move with the d-pad or left stick, seek with the right stick, shoulder "
"buttons to page, Start for the menu. A controller is not focus-aware, so it "
"will reach this app even when another window is in front. Needs an mpv built "
"with SDL2 gamepad support; if yours lacks it this setting is ignored and the "
"log says so. Any button can be reassigned in your input.conf."
msgstr ""
"使用方向键或左摇杆移动，使用右摇杆搜索，肩键翻页，按开始键打开菜单。控制器不"
"具备焦点感知功能，因此即使前面有其他窗口，它也能访问此应用程序。需要使用支持 "
"SDL2 游戏手柄的 mpv 构建；如果您的 mpv 不支持此功能，则此设置将被忽略，日志中"
"会显示相关信息。您可以在 input.conf 文件中重新分配任何按键。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Swap Confirm and Back Buttons" setting
#. (Settings > General > Input).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Turn this on for a controller whose A button is on the right rather than at "
"the bottom (Switch Pro, most 8BitDo pads)."
msgstr ""
"对于 A 键位于右侧而不是底部的控制器（例如 Switch Pro、大多数 8BitDo 手柄），"
"请启用此功能。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Block Player Keybinds While Browsing"
#. setting (Settings > General > Input).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Stops MPV's own shortcuts -- picture adjustment, screenshots, subtitle and "
"audio switching -- from acting while you are in the library, where there is "
"no video for them to act on. Turn it off to use your own MPV key bindings "
"there."
msgstr ""
"此功能会阻止 MPV 自带的快捷键（例如画面调整、截图、字幕和音频切换）在您浏览视"
"频库时生效，因为视频库中没有视频可供这些快捷键使用。关闭此功能即可在视频库中"
"使用您自己的 MPV 快捷键绑定。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Select Key" setting (under Advanced on the
#. General tab of Settings).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Activates whatever is highlighted, in the library and on the player "
"controls. An mpv key name; changing it hands Enter back to MPV. The game "
"controller's Confirm button and a phone's Select follow it."
msgstr ""
"激活库中和播放器控件上高亮显示的任何内容。这是一个MPV键名；更改后按Enter键返"
"回MPV。游戏控制器的“确认”按钮和手机的“选择”键也遵循这一规则。"

#. Help text under the setting above. "Grace period" and "rewatch" are
#. also the words people search the settings box for, so keep whatever the
#. equivalents are in your language.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"A grace period after you finish something: it stays downloaded for this "
"long, so you can rewatch it or somebody else in the house can catch up, "
"instead of going on the next check. Running out of storage still removes "
"watched downloads before the time is up."
msgstr ""

#. Explanation shown under the "Top Up When Fewer Than (episodes)" setting
#. (Settings > Browse > Download Tuning).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave these blank unless downloads are waking your disks too often. Set both "
"of the first two together: episodes are then fetched in one batch when a "
"series runs low, instead of one at a time."
msgstr ""
"除非下载活动导致硬盘过于频繁地被唤醒，否则请将这些选项留空。建议将前两个选项"
"同时设置：这样当剧集库存不足时，系统会批量获取新剧集，而不是逐个下载。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Show Episode Thumbnails on Detail Pages"
#. setting (Settings > Browse > Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"An episode's thumbnail is a frame of an episode you may not have watched yet."
msgstr "剧集缩略图可能是您尚未观看剧集的某一个画面。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Left Click Pauses Playback" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off gives MPV's own mouse behaviour instead: drag the video to move the "
"window, and the right button does whatever your MPV config gives it. Double "
"click is full screen either way."
msgstr ""
"关闭此选项后，MPV 将采用其自身的鼠标行为：拖动视频即可移动窗口，右键则执行 "
"MPV 配置中指定的功能。双击则可全屏显示。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Deinterlace Automatically" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Deinterlace video the file says is interlaced. Off by default, as in MPV "
"itself: the flag is not reliable in either direction, and deinterlacing "
"progressive video softens a picture that was fine. To force it on for "
"something that is interlaced without saying so, use Deinterlace in the "
"player's settings menu, which lasts until you return to the library. Needs "
"MPV 0.38 or newer."
msgstr ""
"对文件显示为隔行扫描的视频进行反交错处理。默认情况下此功能处于关闭状态，就像 "
"MPV 本身一样：该标志在正反方向上都不太可靠，而且对逐行扫描视频进行反交错处理"
"会降低原本清晰的画面质量。要强制对未明确标明为隔行扫描的视频启用此功能，请在"
"播放器的设置菜单中使用“反交错”选项，该设置会在您返回媒体库时生效。需要 MPV "
"0.38 或更高版本。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Debanding" setting (Settings > Playback >
#. Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Smooths the blocky steps that appear in gradients — skies, dark scenes, "
"fades. Animation and anime benefit most, because flat gradients are most of "
"the picture; live action is largely unaffected either way, though a strong "
"setting can soften genuinely fine detail. Costs GPU work whatever the "
"content, which is worth knowing on a small or older machine. Leave this Off "
"if you set the deband options in mpv.conf yourself — Off writes nothing at "
"all, so your values are left alone."
msgstr ""
"平滑渐变中出现的块状台阶 - 天空、黑暗场景、淡入淡出。动画和动漫受益最大，因为"
"平坦的渐变占据了图片的大部分；实景拍摄基本上不受影响，尽管强烈的背景可以柔化"
"真正的细节。无论内容如何，GPU 工作都会花费成本，这在小型或较旧的机器上值得了"
"解。如果您自己在 mpv.conf 中设置 deband 选项，请将此选项保留为 Off — Off 根本"
"不会写入任何内容，因此您的值将保持不变。"

#. Explanation shown under the "HDR Tone Mapping" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"How HDR video is fitted to an SDR display. This does nothing when HDR is "
"being passed through to an HDR display, because no tone mapping is happening "
"to change. Leave it on Automatic unless HDR films look wrong to you; BT.2390 "
"is the reference curve, and Clip is what to try if highlights look grey "
"rather than bright."
msgstr ""
"如何将 HDR 视频适配到 SDR 显示器。当 HDR 传递到 HDR 显示器时，这不会执行任何"
"操作，因为色调映射不会发生变化。将其保留为“自动”，除非 HDR 影片对您来说不合"
"适； BT.2390 是参考曲线，如果高光看起来是灰色而不是明亮，则可以尝试“削峰”。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Rendering Quality" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"High quality applies the same options as MPV's own high-quality preset: "
"better upscaling and HDR handling, at some GPU cost. It needs no shader "
"files and does not use up your shader profile, so it is the thing to try "
"before the shader pack below."
msgstr ""
"高质量模式应用了与 MPV 自带的高质量预设相同的选项：更好的图像放大和 HDR 处"
"理，但会占用一定的 GPU 资源。它不需要着色器文件，也不会占用你的着色器配置文"
"件，因此在尝试下面的着色器包之前，建议先尝试这个模式。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Network Buffer" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Playback).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"How far ahead of playback to read. MPV's default is one second, which is "
"short for a server reached over the internet or a slow connection — raise "
"this if playback keeps stopping for buffering. Larger buffers use more "
"memory and make the first few seconds of a file slower to start."
msgstr ""
"播放前读取多少帧？MPV 的默认值为一秒，这对于通过互联网访问服务器或连接速度较"
"慢的情况来说太短了——如果播放频繁因缓冲而停止，请增加此值。更大的缓冲区会占用"
"更多内存，并导致文件开头几秒的播放速度变慢。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Motion Interpolation" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Frame blending (blends frames together, not the same as SVP/DLSS/framegen). "
"Reduces juddering caused by mismatched frame rate between content and "
"display. May cause dropped frames if your displays have mismatched frame "
"rates."
msgstr ""
"帧混合（将帧混合在一起，与 SVP/DLSS/帧生成不同）。可减少因内容和显示器帧速率"
"不匹配而导致的画面抖动。如果显示器的帧速率不匹配，则可能导致丢帧。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Hardware Decoding" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Playback).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off by default because some graphics drivers handle it badly. \"Only above "
"1080p\" is the cautious way to turn it on: most hardware decodes 1080p in "
"software without help. \"Copy (advanced)\" is slower, but it is the mode "
"that works with video filters, so it is the one to pick if you run SVP or "
"another VapourSynth filter. If video stops working, start with --disable-"
"hwdec and change this back."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下此功能关闭，因为某些显卡驱动程序处理不当。“仅高于 1080p”是一种谨慎"
"的开启方式：大多数硬件无需额外设置即可通过软件解码 1080p 视频。“复制（高级设"
"置）”模式速度较慢，但它是与视频滤镜兼容的模式，因此如果您运行 SVP 或其他 "
"VapourSynth 滤镜，则应选择此模式。如果视频停止工作，请先使用 `--disable-"
"hwdec` 参数，然后再将其改回原设置。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Enable GUI" setting (under Advanced on the
#. General tab of Settings).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off means command-line mode: no window, no system tray and no settings "
"screen, so the only way back is to edit conf.json by hand. This is not how "
"you get MPV's own on-screen controls; use Player Controls Style under "
"Interface for that."
msgstr ""
"Off 表示命令行模式：没有窗口，没有系统托盘，也没有设置屏幕，因此唯一的返回方"
"法是手动编辑conf.json。这不是 MPV 自己的屏幕控制的方式；而是通过这种方式获得"
"的。为此，请使用“界面”下的“播放器控制样式”。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Cast-target mode (no library browsing)"
#. setting (under Advanced on the General tab of Settings).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Show only what is cast to this machine. The library, including this settings "
"screen, cannot be reached from here, and without a system tray icon the only "
"way back is to edit conf.json. This is for a shared TV nobody should be able "
"to browse from; for an ordinary cast target, use the Interface settings."
msgstr ""
"仅显示投屏到此设备的内容。无法从此处访问媒体库（包括此设置屏幕），并且由于没"
"有系统托盘图标，唯一的返回方法是编辑 conf.json 文件。此设置适用于共享电视，任"
"何人都不应能够浏览；对于普通的投屏目标，请使用“界面”设置。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Window Buttons in the Top Bar" setting
#. (Settings > General > Window).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Some desktops, GNOME on Wayland in particular, draw no title bar on the "
"player window, leaving no way to move or close it. This puts minimize, "
"maximize and close in the top bar instead, and lets you drag the window by "
"it. On \"Only when the window has no title bar\", MPV is asked whether this "
"window got one, so desktops that draw a title bar are left alone."
msgstr ""
"某些桌面环境，特别是 Wayland 上的 GNOME，不会在播放器窗口上绘制标题栏，导致无"
"法移动或关闭窗口。在这种情况下，最小化、最大化和关闭按钮会显示在顶部栏中，并"
"允许用户拖动窗口。在“仅当窗口没有标题栏时”的设置下，MPV 会询问此窗口是否绘制"
"了标题栏，因此不会影响那些绘制了标题栏的桌面环境。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Keep Window Buttons in Full Screen" setting
#. (Settings > General > Window).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Full screen has no title bar anywhere and nothing to move or maximize, so "
"the buttons are normally hidden there. Turn this on to keep a way out of "
"full screen that is not a keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"全屏模式下没有标题栏，也没有任何可以移动或最大化的元素，因此按钮通常会被隐藏"
"起来。启用此功能可保留一种非键盘快捷键的退出全屏模式的方法。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Hide the Desktop Title Bar" setting
#. (Settings > General > Window).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Asks the desktop for no title bar on the player window, so the top bar above "
"is the only one. Pairs with the setting above: on \"Only when the window has "
"no title bar\" the buttons appear as soon as this is on. Leave both off "
"unless you want them, since a window with neither can be awkward to move on "
"some desktops."
msgstr ""
"要求桌面系统在播放器窗口上不显示标题栏，这样就只显示顶部的工具栏。此设置与上"
"述“仅当窗口没有标题栏时”设置配合使用：启用此选项后，按钮会立即显示。除非您需"
"要，否则请将这两个设置都关闭，因为在某些桌面系统上，没有标题栏的窗口移动起来"
"可能不太方便。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Enable Trickplay Thumbnails" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Shows a preview frame while you drag the seek bar. Works with every player "
"control style, including your own OSC script if it supports thumbfast. The "
"images are fetched from the server per video, which costs disk space and "
"memory -- tens of MB for an episode, a few hundred for a long film."
msgstr ""
"拖动进度条时显示预览帧。兼容所有播放器控制样式，包括您自己的 OSC 脚本（如果支"
"持 Thumbfast）。图像会根据视频从服务器获取，这会占用磁盘空间和内存——一集视频"
"占用几十 MB，一部长电影占用几百 MB。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Preferred Language" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Subtitles & Languages), which only appears when a Dubbed or
#. Subbed preset is chosen. "Subbed subtitles" means the subtitles used when
#. watching with the original audio; "your mileage may vary" means results
#. may differ for you. "eng" is a literal ISO 639-2 code the user types:
#. keep it as is.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The language to use for dubbed audio or subbed subtitles. Note the "
"preference heuristics are built around English naming conventions, your "
"mileage may vary. Use a language code such as eng."
msgstr ""

#. Explanation shown under the "Load All Seek Previews at Once" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Seek previews are normally fetched a few minutes at a time around where you "
"are seeking, so scrubbing somewhere new waits briefly. Turn this on to load "
"them all up front instead: nothing ever waits, but a long film can cost "
"several hundred MB of memory. Turning it on applies to what you are watching "
"the next time you seek somewhere new; turning it off applies to the next "
"video."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下，搜索预览会以几分钟为单位，在你搜索的位置附近逐段加载，因此快进到"
"新位置时会稍作等待。启用此功能后，所有预览将一次性全部加载完毕：这样就不会有"
"任何等待，但一部长影片可能会占用数百MB的内存。启用此功能后，下次快进到新位置"
"时，预览将自动加载；禁用此功能后，预览将自动加载到下一个视频。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Player Controls Style" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"MPV keybinds are used by default. Press ENTER to drive the player controls "
"by keyboard. \"No player controls\" leaves playback bare; the library, the "
"keyboard shortcuts and the menu key still work. Choose \"Custom OSC\" when "
"you have installed your own OSC script: it turns MPV's own off and gives the "
"library a solid background, so the script's idle screen cannot show through "
"it."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下使用 MPV 快捷键。按 Enter 键即可通过键盘控制播放器。“无播放器控制”"
"选项会使播放界面保持简洁；媒体库、键盘快捷键和菜单键仍然有效。如果您已安装自"
"己的 OSC 脚本，请选择“自定义 OSC”：它会关闭 MPV 自带的 OSC，并将媒体库设置为"
"纯色背景，这样脚本的空闲画面就不会透过背景显示出来。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Scroll Wheel Pixels" setting (Settings >
#. Browse > Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Pixels one wheel notch scrolls. Raise it to scroll faster, lower it for "
"finer control. On a grid the value is rounded so that a whole number of "
"notches spans one row, in every scroll mode, so a trackpad or trackball "
"never leaves you a sliver of a row off."
msgstr ""
"像素级滚轮的滚动位置为一格。向上滚动可加快滚动速度，向下滚动可实现更精细的控"
"制。在网格上，滚动位置的值会进行四舍五入，因此在任何滚动模式下，整数格数都对"
"应一行，所以触控板或轨迹球永远不会出现滚动位置偏离一行的情况。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Scroll Mode" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Continuous\" scrolls by pixels and lands wherever the wheel puts it, "
"lining rows up by itself if the display cannot keep up. Pick \"Aligned to "
"rows\" if scrolling still stutters, as it can on a very large, slow or "
"remote display, or with an external MPV. Pick \"One row per notch\" to move "
"a whole row, or one home-screen section, at a time."
msgstr ""
"“连续”滚动以像素为单位，滚动到滚轮所到之处即可停止，如果显示屏跟不上滚动速"
"度，则会自动对齐行。如果滚动仍然卡顿（例如在超大、慢速或远程显示屏上，或使用"
"外接MPV时），请选择“按行对齐”。选择“每格移动一行”可一次移动一整行或一个主屏幕"
"区域。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Show What You're Watching in Discord"
#. setting (Settings > General > This Device).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid "Discord Rich Presence."
msgstr "Discord 高级状态。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Audio Output Device" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Audio).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave this to Default unless setting up passthrough. Note some audio servers "
"like Pipewire don't like passthrough and will need to be disabled for a card "
"before it'll let *any* audio through in passthrough mode. In my tests I got "
"silence otherwise, but results may vary."
msgstr ""
"若无直通需求请保持 Default。部分音频服务（如 Pipewire）对音频直通兼容性较差，"
"需单独关闭声卡限制才能正常输出 Passthrough 音频，否则可能出现无声，不同设备表"
"现存在差异。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Take the Device Exclusively" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Audio).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Stop anything else using the device while playing. Needed for passthrough on "
"some systems, and it means other applications will be silent."
msgstr ""
"播放时独占音频设备，切断其他程序音频输出。部分系统开启 Passthrough 必须启用此"
"项，开启后其他软件将静音。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Paginated" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Page the library and music tile grids instead of scrolling: each page is one "
"screenful with First / Previous / Next / Last controls and a page number you "
"can type into. Easier than precise scrolling on a trackpad."
msgstr ""
"媒体库、音乐封面改为分页浏览，替代长滚动；单页铺满屏幕，支持 First / "
"Previous / Next / Last 跳转与页码输入，Trackpad 操作更便捷。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Make Live TV logos more legible" setting
#. (Settings > Browse > Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Channel logos are ink on a transparent background, drawn for the white page "
"other clients put them on, so on a dark one the black ones vanish. On, each "
"logo gets the light plate it was made for, and the few with a white outline "
"get a drop shadow so they keep an edge against it. Off, they get the theme's "
"card colour and no shadow, as Jellyfin Web does."
msgstr ""
"频道标志采用透明背景的墨水绘制，专为其他客户使用的白色背景而设计，因此在深色"
"背景上，黑色标志会消失。在深色背景上，每个标志都会使用其原本设计的浅色背景，"
"少数带有白色轮廓的标志还会添加阴影，以保持边缘清晰。在深色背景上，标志则会使"
"用主题卡片的颜色，并且不添加阴影，就像 Jellyfin Web 的做法一样。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Make library logos more legible" setting
#. (Settings > Browse > Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The same treatment for a library set to draw Logo artwork. Off by default: a "
"film or series logo is white by convention and already reads on a dark "
"background, and it is the plate that makes it need a shadow. Turn it on if "
"yours are dark."
msgstr ""
"用于绘制 Logo 图形的库也采用相同的处理方式。默认情况下处于关闭状态：按照惯"
"例，电影或节目的 Logo 为白色，并且在深色背景上已经清晰可见，正是底片本身才需"
"要阴影。如果您的 Logo 为深色背景，请启用此功能。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Theme" setting (Settings > Browse > Theme).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Palette, glow, cover style and default cover size. Colours change "
"immediately; cover and heading sizes take effect after a restart."
msgstr ""
"调色板、光效、封面样式及默认封面尺寸。颜色会立即更改；封面和标题尺寸的更改需"
"重启后生效。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Grid Spacing" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Where the width a whole number of covers does not use ends up. Widening the "
"gaps keeps the page margins the same on every screen size; centring keeps "
"the covers evenly spaced and moves both margins instead."
msgstr ""
"当封面宽度未被整数倍使用时，剩余部分就会被放置在那里。加宽间距可以确保页面边"
"距在所有屏幕尺寸上都保持一致；居中则可以使封面间距均匀，并同时调整两个边距。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Full-Width Backdrops" setting (Settings >
#. Browse > Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Run the backdrop on a detail page to the edges of the window, as the web "
"client does. It shows more of the artwork without taking any more vertical "
"space."
msgstr ""
"将详情页的背景图延伸到窗口边缘，就像网页客户端那样。这样既能展示更多图片内"
"容，又不会占用更多垂直空间。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Cover Size" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Theme).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid "Overrides the theme's cover size. Also on the View menu of any library."
msgstr "覆盖主题的封面大小。也可以在任何媒体库的“查看”菜单上。"

#. Explanation shown under the "12-Hour Clock" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Library Browser).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Show times of day as \"8:30 PM\" rather than \"20:30\" — the Live TV guide "
"and its air times, and the \"Ends at\" labels on a detail page and the "
"player controls."
msgstr ""
"将一天中的时间显示为“晚上 8:30”而不是“20:30”——直播电视指南及其播出时间，以及"
"详情页和播放器控件上的“结束于”标签。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Shading Behind the Player Controls" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The controls have to stay legible over any frame. \"None\" gives the text a "
"drop shadow instead of shading the picture behind it."
msgstr ""
"控件在任何边框上都必须清晰可见。“无”选项会使文本带有阴影，而不是为后面的图片"
"添加阴影。"

#. Explanation shown under the "When the Player Controls Hide" setting
#. (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Hide unless hovered\" keeps them up only while the pointer is on them, "
"paused or not."
msgstr "“鼠标悬停时隐藏”选项仅在鼠标指针悬停在其上时显示，无论鼠标是否暂停。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Hide the Player Controls After (seconds)"
#. setting (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"0 hides them as soon as the pointer is not on them, and forces \"Hide unless "
"hovered\"."
msgstr "0 表示当指针不在它们上面时立即隐藏它们，并强制“除非悬停，否则隐藏”。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Shrink the Player Controls on a Narrow
#. Window" setting (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Narrowing the window shrinks the controls until the smallest button reaches "
"the accessibility minimum, instead of dropping buttons sooner. Off keeps the "
"older, larger floor."
msgstr ""
"缩小窗口会缩小控件，直到最小的按钮达到无障碍访问的最小尺寸，而不是提前缩小按"
"钮。关闭此选项会保留原有的、较大的控件层级。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Mouse Back/Forward Buttons Skip Chapters"
#. setting (Settings > Playback > Player Controls).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"During playback only; in the library those buttons stay Back and Forward. "
"Off by default because they are easy to hit by accident on some mice."
msgstr ""
"仅在播放时有效；在媒体库中，这些按钮始终保持“后退”和“前进”功能。默认情况下处"
"于关闭状态，因为在某些鼠标上很容易误触这些按钮。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Interface Scale" setting (Settings > Browse
#. > Theme).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"\"Follow display\" uses the scale your desktop reports, which is 100% on X11."
msgstr "“跟随显示”使用桌面报告的比例，在 X11 上为 100%。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Text size" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Theme).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Scales the text only. Interface Scale above resizes everything, artwork and "
"spacing and controls included, so use this one when the words are too small "
"rather than the whole interface. It stops at 150%: past that most tile "
"captions are ellipsized, and what needs to be bigger is the whole interface, "
"which is Interface Scale."
msgstr ""
"仅缩放文本。上面的“界面缩放”会调整所有内容，包括图片、间距和控件，因此当文字"
"太小而不是整个界面太小时，请使用此选项。它的最大缩放比例为 150%：超过此比例"
"后，大多数图块标题会被省略，需要放大的是整个界面，这需要使用“界面缩放”选项。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Minimum Text Size" setting (Settings >
#. Browse > Theme).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Nothing renders smaller than this, whatever Text Size works out to. Raises "
"the smallest labels without enlarging headings, which a percentage cannot do."
msgstr ""
"无论文本大小如何，没有什么比这个更小的渲染了。升起最小的标签而不放大标题，这"
"是百分比无法做到的。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Audio Output Mode" setting (Settings >
#. Playback > Audio).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Default\" changes nothing and lets MPV (and your own mpv.conf) decide. "
"Pick a mode only if you are sending audio to a receiver."
msgstr ""
"「Default」不做强制限制，由 MPV 及 mpv.conf 配置决定输出模式；仅外接功放时手"
"动选择对应模式。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Re-encode Others to AC3" setting (Settings
#. > Playback > Audio).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Audio your receiver cannot be sent directly is encoded to AC3, the only way "
"surround fits down an optical cable. Turn this off if the encoder causes "
"audio delay; those tracks become stereo instead."
msgstr ""
"无法直接发送给您的接收器的音频被编码为AC3格式，这是唯一能让环绕声通过光纤传输"
"的方式。如果编码器导致音频延迟，请关闭此功能；这些音轨将变为立体声。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Profile Group" setting (Settings > Playback
#. > Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"hq\" offers heavier profiles. Pick it if you have a fast graphics card."
msgstr "「hq」画质 Profile 负载更高，显卡性能充足时选择此项。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Graphics API for Shaders" setting (Settings
#. > Playback > Video Enhancement).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave on Automatic unless video breaks when a profile is loaded. This only "
"applies while a profile is active, and OpenGL can cost you HDR output."
msgstr ""
"无画质加载异常请保持 Automatic；仅在启用 Profile 时生效，OpenGL 模式可能丢失 "
"HDR 输出。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Type Size" setting (Settings > Browse >
#. Reading).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"In pixels, before interface scaling. The A- and A+ buttons in the reader "
"change this too."
msgstr ""
"以像素为单位，这是界面缩放之前的尺寸。阅读器中的 A- 和 A+ 按钮也会改变这个尺"
"寸。"

#. Explanation shown under the "Comic Reading Mode" setting (Settings >
#. Browse > Reading).
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"How a comic page is fitted to the window when you open it. The reader's own "
"buttons change this too."
msgstr ""
"当你打开漫画时，漫画页面会如何适应窗口大小？读者自己的按键也会改变这一点。"

